==English==

===Etymology===
Variant of ''[[memento]]'' from association with memorable ''[[moment]]s''.

===Noun===
{{head|en|misspelling}}

# {{misspelling of|memento|lang=en}}

===Usage notes===
The alternative spelling ''[[momento]]'' is so common, some references now no longer consider it a misspelling.

